      "Language": "ger",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Veins of the limbs of 193 sudden deaths are examined concerning the frequency, extent and localisation of sclerosis. The macroscopic process of preparation has been satisfactory. Correlations to several factors, especially age and diseases of heart and arteries, are presented and discussed."},
